+/// Capture the complete effective principal set into an internal-only token.
+/// Promise.js retains the token in a lexical WeakMap, so delayed reaction
+/// attachment cannot erase the settlement context. Optional prior tokens are
+/// merged monotonically for Promise assimilation and adoption.
+CallResult<HermesValue> hermesInternalCaptureJobConstrainedPrincipals(
+    void *,
